{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Veinrider</strong> is a short, incremental game where you pilot a gravity-flipping mining craft through the caves of an alien world. Each run yields resources you can invest into permanent upgrades, turning your fragile rig into an unstoppable mining juggernaut.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Incremental Growth</strong>: mine resources, trade them in, and steadily improve your ship\u2019s shields, weapons, and systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Core Gameplay</strong>: simple gravity-flip controls inspired by classics\u2014easy to pick up, satisfying to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Terrain</strong>: carve through alien caverns, uncover embedded minerals, and refine your path for efficiency.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Corporate Mining Fantasy</strong>: exploit the planet for your employers, while you quietly prepare your own way out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig, upgrade, and push deeper\u2014until the planet gives up all it has to offer.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4110670?t=1763720375","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110670/5bf8506f789e0ce5d0472d63404eed8a2bf74bdc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763720375","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110670/a7b77048fbdc5447eaf475061393cd0b9da9450f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763720375","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110670/a7b77048fbdc5447eaf475061393cd0b9da9450f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763720375","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\